      "review_description": "All in all I had 5 quotes inclusive of the company that was recomended by this site i.e Austec Unfortunately the sales person who came did not have his file with him as he had left it at the orevious clients house. I'd imagine that the products they carry are good nevertheless but I'm sorry the other 4 companies that came were much more professional and have very competitive products/prices.I find that most products do go head to head. I was torn between SolarHarness and Unltd Solar and decided to go with the latter. Installation was done in 1.5 hours (due to rain) and the installers are very quick and professional and lead installer is an electrician himself so system are connected and working from the get go. I have heard that some installers do not have certified electrician to connect the system but I didn't have that as a personal experience. All in all I'd recomend Unltd Solar. Very knowledgable, excellent customer service, great value for money.",
